    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432000/extras/03b2c937e95a6d7ee0b802037214ee02.poster.avif?t=1750000415\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432000/extras/03b2c937e95a6d7ee0b802037214ee02.webm?t=1750000415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432000/extras/03b2c937e95a6d7ee0b802037214ee02.mp4?t=1750000415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory of Lust</strong> is an <strong>adult visual novel</strong> that immerses players in a world of mystery, romance, and captivating storytelling. Awakening in a beautiful yet enigmatic town with no memory of who you are or why you're there, you must unravel the secrets of your past. Your choices will ignite events that not only shape your fate but also impact the lives of the town's inhabitants in profound ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432000/extras/b0e1bf726c238ec78d9cff69525f880b.poster.avif?t=1750000415\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432000/extras/b0e1bf726c238ec78d9cff69525f880b.webm?t=1750000415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432000/extras/b0e1bf726c238ec78d9cff69525f880b.mp4?t=1750000415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into the mysteries buried within this fascinating world. Uncover fragments of a forgotten past and realize your significance in this intricate web of relationships and secrets. The questions linger: <strong>Who are you, and how great is your role in this world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative is <strong>non-linear</strong>, blending a gripping main storyline with <strong>numerous side stories</strong>. This structure allows players to forge connections with a diverse cast of characters, delving into their unique lives. Through these interactions, you'll uncover mysteries, access <strong>romantic storylines</strong>, and experience unforgettable moments that deepen your ties to the world and its people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432000/extras/5fb4a2da2ebb478d3bb50a8ca46af1a0.poster.avif?t=1750000415\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432000/extras/5fb4a2da2ebb478d3bb50a8ca46af1a0.webm?t=1750000415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432000/extras/5fb4a2da2ebb478d3bb50a8ca46af1a0.mp4?t=1750000415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich storytelling:</strong> Embark on a journey through an interactive narrative brimming with intrigue and emotion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive atmosphere:</strong>\u00a0Traverse vividly detailed locations, from mysterious churches to opulent vampire mansions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-driven gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Connect with a diverse array of characters, unlocking <strong>meaningful romantic and intimate encounters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery and discovery:</strong>\u00a0Delve into the secrets of the town, uncovering layers of hidden truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artistic excellence:</strong>\u00a0Marvel at hundreds of finely crafted renders and environments designed to captivate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your own adventure</strong>\u00a0in this unforgettable exploration of love, secrets, and destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
